[69.832492, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[KTest fails as expected \u2014 only values 1\u201323 appear and there are two 0s (the center and one more cell\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Knever got filled). Now I'll fix the off-by-one in the last loop bound:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m[Checkpoint cp-1794570647538-2: /tmp/ami-demo-v3se0l/spiral.py]\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25bc \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan file_edit(/tmp/ami-demo-v3se0l/spiral.py) +1 -3 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[38;5;35m\u2713\u001b[39m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;167mfile_edit\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\u001b[2m \u00b7 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;243m/tmp/ami-demo-v3se0l/spiral.py\u001b[39m\u001b[2m \u00b7 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35m(+1 -3)\u001b[39m\u001b[2m \u00b7 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35m138 tok\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;243m  \u23bf  diff \u00b7 \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;75m/tmp/ami-demo-v3se0l/spiral.py\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m 0  [edit: spiral.py, 6 lines changed]\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m 1  Successfully edited /tmp/ami-demo-v3se0l/spiral.py\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m 2  \u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m20              value += 1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m21          bottom -= 1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m22  \u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[22m23-         # \u001b[32mBUG:\u001b[39m should be range(bottom, top - 1, -1); using `top` drops the\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[22m24-         # final single-cell center ring for odd N (e.g. N=5 center stays 0).\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[22m25-         for row in range(bottom, top, -1):\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2502  \u001b[22m23+         for row in range(bottom, top - 1, -1):\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m  \u2502  24              matrix[row][left] = value\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m  \u2502  25              value += 1\u